{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- THE GAME -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou Lensed Night Sky, Kaseigai is a nontraditional bullet hell that focuses on a fully modular loadout. The player's own attacks and special effects can be exchanged midway through runs as the situation demands, or simply for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a lot of ways to approach the game, with three playable characters, four major difficulty options, and a myriad of challenges and difficulty-lowering options that can be enabled or disabled at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/extras/116a370bdcc4bcb7af14588a2e891bc4.poster.avif?t=1769114985\" width=290 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/extras/116a370bdcc4bcb7af14588a2e891bc4.webm?t=1769114985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/extras/116a370bdcc4bcb7af14588a2e891bc4.mp4?t=1769114985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- TOUHOU PROJECT -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fanwork of Touhou Project, a multimedia series that takes place in a hidden country called Gensokyo. The characters and setting in this game are the same as those in the official releases. However, some time has passed for them. Maybe everyone is not exactly as you recall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're not familiar with the Touhou Project series, don't worry! Touhou Lensed Night Sky, Kaseigai is relatively self-explanatory and doesn't demand additional knowledge in order to be played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/extras/2448cbeededab779e133c899facd8324.poster.avif?t=1769114985\" width=290 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/extras/2448cbeededab779e133c899facd8324.webm?t=1769114985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/extras/2448cbeededab779e133c899facd8324.mp4?t=1769114985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- FEATURES -</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over two hundred items! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a bazillion bullets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of challenges to make the game universally easier or harder!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least four marketable plushies, and one absolutely unmarketable one!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hundred and twenty thousand lines of code! (Most people don't care about this one) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And 36 bad endings uniquely written for every possible loss! Never a run wasted if there's a new dumb joke at the end!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1825250?t=1769114985","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769114985","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769114985","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769114985","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","