 everyone is not exactly as you recall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're not familiar with the Touhou Project series, don't worry! Touhou Lensed Night Sky, Kaseigai is relatively self-explanatory and doesn't demand additional knowledge in order to be played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/extras/2448cbeededab779e133c899facd8324.poster.avif?t=1769114985\" width=290 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/extras/2448cbeededab779e133c899facd8324.webm?t=1769114985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825250/extras/2448cbeededab779e133c899facd8324.mp4?t=1769114985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- FEATURES -</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over two hundred items! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a bazillion bullets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of challenges to make the game universally easier or harder!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least four marketable plushies, and one absolutely unmarketable one!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One hundred and twenty thousand lines of code! (Most people don't care about this one) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And 36 bad endings uniquely written for every possible loss! Never a run wasted if there's a new dumb joke at the end!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fire Land"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description"